            "line": 45,
            "text": "theorem Sq_eq_radial {h j Λ : ℝ} {P0 a₀ : ℝ → ℝ} {f U V Pr : ℝ × ℝ → ℝ}\n    (hs : IsNaturalSolution h j Λ P0 a₀ f U V Pr)\n    {p : ℝ × ℝ} (hp : p ∈ domain Λ) (hf : f p ≠ 0) :\n    Sq h f U V p = -2 * NaturalAxisData.L h p.2 * radialDifferential 2 f p / f p"
